  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.",
